Method: sampled every 3s for 200s while six loans were driven end to end
through the stack (all reached COMPLETED/FUNDED; maestro_workflow_failed_total
stayed absent). Containers: docker stats MemUsage. Host JVMs: ps RSS, which
counts the whole process (heap + metaspace + thread stacks + code cache), not
just the 256m -Xmx. Per-component PEAK, then summed -- deliberately
pessimistic, since the components do not all peak at the same instant.

Default demo shape: 6 containers + 4 host JVMs (three loan services + admin).
docker stats rows from OTHER projects on this machine are excluded by the
maestro-demo-* name filter.

samples: 29 over 200s at 3s intervals

